{"item_uid": "學測111-math_a-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 111, "year_ce": 2022, "subject_key": "math_a", "subject_zh": "數學A", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "有一款線上遊戲推出「十連抽」的抽卡機制，「十連抽」意思為系統自動做十次的抽卡動作。若每次「十連抽」需用1500枚代幣，抽中金卡的機率在前九次皆為2%，在第十次為10%。今某生有代幣23000枚，且不斷使用「十連抽」，抽到不能再抽為止。則某生抽到金卡張數的期望值為張。", "options": {}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第13題至第17題，每題5分。", "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "p_value": 46.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [74.0, 59.0, 48.0, 33.0, 14.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測111-math_a-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 111, "year_ce": 2022, "subject_key": "math_a", "subject_zh": "數學A", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "已知、為實數，且方程組恰有一組解，又此方程組經過一系列的高斯消去法運算後，原來的增廣矩陣可化為。則，。\n（化為最簡分數）", "options": {}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第13題至第17題，每題5分。", "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "p_value": 21.0, "p_high": 46.0, "p_low": 3.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [57.0, 26.0, 13.0, 6.0, 2.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測111-math_a-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 111, "year_ce": 2022, "subject_key": "math_a", "subject_zh": "數學A", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如圖，王家有塊三角形土地，其中公尺。政府擬徵收其中梯形部分，開闢以直線為邊線的馬路，其路寬為公尺，這讓王家土地只剩原有面積的。經協商，改以開闢平行直線為邊線的馬路，且路寬不變，其中，則只需徵收區域。依此協商，王家剩餘的土地有平方公尺。", "options": {}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第13題至第17題，每題5分。", "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "p_value": 16.0, "p_high": 37.0, "p_low": 2.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [49.0, 17.0, 8.0, 4.0, 1.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測111-math_a-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 111, "year_ce": 2022, "subject_key": "math_a", "subject_zh": "數學A", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "坐標空間中，平面上有兩相異直線與。\n已知也在另一平面上，且在的投影與重合。\n則的方程式為。", "options": {}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第13題至第17題，每題5分。", "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "p_value": 18.0, "p_high": 45.0, "p_low": 1.0, "discrimination": 44.0, "p_quintiles": [59.0, 22.0, 8.0, 3.0, 1.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
